not derivative works of the profiles.

Not used, deliberately
----------------------
Stuart Sowerby's X-Trans II LUT set (https://blog.sowerby.me/fuji-film-simulation-profiles/)
is the closer sensor-generation match for the X-T1, but is published "All Rights
Reserved" with no redistribution licence, so it is not bundled here.


